# Dependency and editor ignores

This file keeps the repository clean for common local development artifacts.

```gitignore
# Node / JavaScript
node_modules/
.npm/
.env
.env.*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Build output
build/
dist/
out/
coverage/
.pytest_cache/

# OS/editor files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
```
